  "private": true,
  "//copilotkit-preview-pin": [
    "TEMPORARY, MUST BE REVERTED BEFORE RELEASE. Tracked in PNI-275.",
    "The @copilotkit/* dependencies below point at pkg.pr.new preview builds of",
    "CopilotKit PR #5873 (github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/5873, branch",
    "mme/subagents) instead of a released version. The deepagents_subagents demo",
    "needs the useSubagent hook, which that PR adds and which exists in no",
    "published @copilotkit/react-core (latest released is 1.66.2 and does not",
    "export it). Without this the dojo does not build at all.",
    "Pinned to COMMIT c2fca03, not the moving @5873 tag. The tag tracks the PR's",
    "latest build, and pnpm caches a tarball against the URL string -- so when",
    "the PR is rebuilt, a tag-pinned URL silently keeps serving the OLD cached",
    "build even through `pnpm install --force`. A commit-pinned URL is a new",
    "string, so it always resolves fresh. Bump the sha when you need a newer",
    "CopilotKit build.",
    "All six are pinned together on purpose: the preview react-core is 1.62.2 and",
    "resolves its own @copilotkit siblings to commit-pinned preview URLs, so",
    "leaving the others on 1.61.2 would load two incompatible copies.",
    "Replace all six with the first released version that exports useSubagent.",
    "Caveat: .npmrc sets block-exotic-subdeps=true, and the preview react-core",
    "declares its siblings as URL deps, so a FRESH resolution is refused. Normal",
    "work is unaffected — `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` (CI) and",
    "`pnpm i --lockfile-only` (pre-commit hook) both succeed against the committed",
    "lockfile with the guard left on. Only re-resolving these six from scratch",
    "needs `npm_config_block_exotic_subdeps=false pnpm install` for that one run.",
    "Do not turn the guard off in .npmrc to work around this."
  ],
